<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n28345" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δραστ-ήριος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>active, efficacious,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μηχανή</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					A.
					<u>Th.</u>
					1046
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φάρμακον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					E.
					<u>Ion</u>
					1185
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀνὴρ δ. ἐς τὰ πάντα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Th.
					4.81
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸ δ.</span>”
				<i>activity, energy,</i>
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					2.63
				</span></i>
			. Adv.
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-ίως</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ph.
					1.104
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Jul.
				<u>Ep.</u>
				10
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hierocl.
				<u>in CA</u>
				26p.479M.
			</span></i>
		</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> rarely in bad sense, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὰ δεινὰ καὶ δ.</span>”
				<i>audacious deeds,</i>
				 <i><span class="en">
					E.
					<u>Or.</u>
					1554
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>
			<i>active,</i> opp. <i>passive,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Plot.
				6.1.29
			</span></i>; esp. in Gramm., of verbs, <i><span class="en">
				D.H.
				<u>Th.</u>
				24
			</span></i>. Adv.
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-ίως</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Syrian.
					<u>in Metaph.</u>
					82.31
				</span></i>
			.</div>
